        <item>
            <title>0.15.93</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:31:06 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>254</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.93</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>With Bluetooth headphones, recording now starts right away. On the Auto microphone setting Corder records with the Mac&#x27;s microphone and never switches the headphones into headset mode, so they keep their full sound quality. This also holds when you put the headphones on in the middle of a recording. If you picked a microphone yourself, Corder uses it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
